# Build context for platform/api/Dockerfile, platform/worker/Dockerfile and
# platform/infra/docker/migrate.Dockerfile is platform/ (D-022).
# Workspace package.json files must stay in the context (npm ci checks them against the lockfile),
# so only heavy or sensitive sub-paths are excluded, never whole workspaces.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/.data
**/.cache
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# GEN-1: never send local env files or keys into an image build
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# large and not needed at runtime
e2e/marketing-baseline
e2e/playwright-report
catalog/sources
# infrastructure code is not shipped, except the migrations entrypoint
infra/*
!infra/docker
